160;of service\n</th>\n<td>6 years (May 1, 2090- July 10, 2096)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Rank\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mexico\" title=\"Mexico\">Lt. Commander</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Joaquin Andrade</b> was a Mexican statesman and political leader who served as the 72nd President of the Mexico from 2114 to 2126. Andrade was the first member of the National Action Party to win the Mexican presidency in 36 years, defeating Miguel Caso in the elections of 2114. Andrade was a central figure in Mexico's strategy of destabilization against the United States, having ordered the engineering of the <a href=\"/wiki/India_Crisis\" title=\"India Crisis\">India Crisis</a> and renewed hostilities in China.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081948\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7653/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10039/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2883/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.843      1 Template:Infobox_officeholder\n100.00%   53.843      1 -total\n 57.00%   30.689     16 Template:Infobox_officeholder/Office\n 18.52%    9.970      1 Template:Infobox_officeholder/Personal_data\n  4.85%    2.614      2 Template:KMT\n  4.19%    2.254      1 Template:DPP\n  3.34%    1.801      1 Template:Px\n  2.56%    1.379      1 Template:KMT/logo\n  2.30%    1.237      1 Template:WPMILHIST_Infobox_style\n  1.98%    1.067      1 Template:DPP/logo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:2235-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119081948 and revision id 9115. Rendering was triggered because: page-view